<view class="page with-action"><state-view status="{{status}}" title="{{status==='empty'?'还没有结对的孩子':''}}" message="{{error || '结对后才能保存陪伴记录。'}}" actionText="{{status==='empty'?'结对说明':'重试'}}" bind:retry="load" bind:action="help"/><block wx:if="{{status==='ready'}}"><view class="field"><view class="label">陪伴对象</view><picker range="{{children}}" range-key="name" value="{{childIndex}}" bindchange="child" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="input">{{children[childIndex].name}} · {{children[childIndex].grade}}</view></picker></view><view class="field"><view class="label">陪伴方式</view><view class="choice-grid"><button wx:for="{{types}}" wx:key="name" class="choice {{type===item.name?'active':''}}" data-name="{{item.name}}" bindtap="type" disabled="{{busy}}"><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/{{item.icon}}.svg"/>{{item.name}}</button></view></view><view class="field"><view class="label">这次陪伴，发生了什么</view><textarea class="input content" value="{{content}}" maxlength="1000" focus="{{focus}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="可以记录一起做的事、孩子的表达，以及下次想继续的事。"/><view class="row between field-hint"><text>记录具体观察，少下结论。</text><text>{{content.length}}/1000</text></view><view wx:if="{{fieldError}}" class="field-error">{{fieldError}}</view></view><view class="field"><view class="row between"><view class="label">添加图片（选填）</view><text class="small">{{images.length}}/3</text></view><view class="upload-grid"><view wx:for="{{images}}" wx:key="*this" class="upload-thumb"><image src="{{item}}" mode="aspectFill"/><button class="remove" data-i="{{index}}" bindtap="remove" aria-label="删除图片" disabled="{{busy}}"><image src="/assets/icons/close-active.svg"/></button></view><button wx:if="{{images.length<3}}" class="upload" bindtap="upload" disabled="{{busy}}"><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/plus.svg"/>添加图片</button></view><view class="field-hint">最多 3 张，每张不超过 5MB。避免上传可识别身份的照片。当前图片仅为本次 mock 会话演示。</view></view><view class="notice"><image class="icon" src="/assets/icons/shield.svg"/><text>记录仅对有权限的志愿者与管理者可见。首次使用应先完成隐私告知与必要授权。</text></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-inline">{{error}}<text> 已保留草稿，请修改或重试。</text></view></block><view class="bottom-action"><button class="btn" disabled="{{busy || status!=='ready'}}" bindtap="submit">{{busy?'正在保存':'保存陪伴记录'}}</button></view></view>